# Local credentials, editor state, and recordings never belong in shared history.
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.blend1
*.blend2
*.log
.codex/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Bulk research scans are distributed as an optional private Release attachment.
# The published pool's source scans and all runtime art remain in Git.
assets/reference/oracle/*/images/

# Local WebP working copies (issue #200): materialized from the "Catalogue artwork - WebP 85 - v1"
# Release by tools/content/sync_webp_working_copies.py. Each receipt's own `working_copy` field
# (committed) names the exact release/asset to regenerate this from -- no need to keep it in Git.
assets/reference/oracle/*/webp/

# Personal agent memory is not the team record.
CLAUDE.local.md
